{"id":"rapidez","lemma":"rapidez","pos":"noun","rank":4680,"glosses":["speed"],"ipa":"/rapiˈdeθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rapideces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-rapidez.wav","examples":[{"text":"No actuaron con rapidez.","en":"They didn't act quickly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639329","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to act, to behave","l":"actuar"},{"g":"with"},null]},{"text":"Mi hermano mayor terminó su tarea con gran rapidez.","en":"My big brother finished his homework very quickly.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"of age"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"task"},{"g":"with"},null,null]},{"text":"Las malas hierbas crecen con una rapidez increíble.","en":"Weeds grow incredibly fast.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"bad","l":"malo"},{"g":"grass","l":"hierba"},{"g":"to grow","l":"crecer"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"incredible"}]}]}